LobsterAI / OpenClaw v2026.8.1: load file-URL plugin entries with native Node require.

Windows import callers pass file URLs. Decode only at the native require and
require-cache eviction boundaries; keep ESM import specifiers, SDK alias hooks,
source-transform fallback flags, and real module errors unchanged.

Regression proof (Windows Node 24.15.0): 9 failures before, 32 passing after.
